%20%20%27Reviewed%20all%20five%20complete%20providers%20at8ef026a395ebbbc415f948777f7f6f7e082a572e%20against8d77e476.%20Only%20translation%2Femit-javascript.js%20changes%3A%20actual%20checked%20external%20owners%20reserve%20target%20names%2C%20the%20same%20shared%20normally%20generated%20binding%2Fcall%20decisions%20render%20those%20existing%20calls%20and%20function%20references%2C%20and%20ordinary%20declarations%20keep%20their%20old%20path.%20An%20exact964-byte%20diff%20and%20complete%20inverse%20restore%20every%20prior%20provider%20byte.%20Old%20overlays%2Fdecorator%20actions%20and%20all%20ownership%2Fdescriptor%2Fcertificate%2FLinkId%20gates%20remain%20unchanged.%20Current%20standalone%2Flinked%2Fnative%20behavior%20still%20requires%20its%20independent%20tests%3B%20source%20review%20is%20no%20runtime%20proof.%27%2C%0A%20%20%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20profiles%3Drevisions.map%28%28revision%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20providers%3D%5B%5D%2Cinverse%3D%5B%5D%2Ccertificates%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%5Bowner%2Cmodule%5Dof%20modules.entries%28%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20file%3D%27js%2Fsrc%2F%27%2Bmodule%2Cold%3Dcapture%28predecessor%2Cfile%29%2Ccurrent%3Dcapture%28revision%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28index%3D%3D%3D1%29%7Bassert.equal%28current.sha256%2CcurrentHashes%5Bowner%5D%2C%27the%20complete%20reviewed%20current%20provider%27%29%3Bassert.equal%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%2Ccurrent.source%2C%27current%20bytes%20must%20belong%20to%20the%20real%20provider%20checkpoint%27%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20providers.push%28%7Bmodule%2CsourceSha256%3Acurrent.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20certificates.push%28%7Bmodule%2Ccurrent%3A%7Brevision%2Csource%3Acurrent.source%2Ccertificate%3Acurrent.certificate%7D%2Cprevious%3A%7Brevision%3Apredecessor%2Csource%3Aold.source%2Ccertificate%3Aold.certificate%7D%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28current.source%21%3D%3Dold.source%29inverse.push%28%7Bmodule%2Cfrom%